          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild clear rhinorrhoea; no sinus tenderness. Alert and oriented to person, place, and time; grossly non-focal neurologic examination. No jaundice, rash, or obvious forearm track marks. No chest pain, shortness of breath, fever, or weight loss reported. No current suicidal ideation or psychosis reported."
